OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWinds soon strengthening with a
OL,6,Frisk of gales developing. Otherwise it
OL,7,Fwill be a largely dry and cloudy day
OL,8,Fwith some bright intervals. Rain
OL,9,Fstarting to spread into the far west
OL,10,Fby early evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy in the evening with
OL,13,Frain spreading into the west and
OL,14,Fbecoming heavy at times. Rain
OL,15,Fcontinues eastwards overnight to cover
OL,16,Fall areas. Strong winds through the
OL,17,Fevening, easing overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
