OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FRain, heavy at times, clears
OL,6,Fto the east through the morning. The
OL,7,Fafternoon will see increasingly bright
OL,8,Fspells developing with the odd shower
OL,9,Fpossible.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBright
OL,12,Fspells and showers early Friday, then
OL,13,Fdrier with clearer skies later. Mostly
OL,14,Fdry with sunny spells and light winds
OL,15,Fthrough the weekend. Chillier nights
OL,16,Fthan of late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
